Source: open-ndi-monitor
Section: video
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Micah Mount <micah.mount@open-ndi-monitor.com>
Build-Depends: cmake, pkg-config, libsdl2-dev, libsamplerate0-dev, debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://github.com/anomalyco/open-ndi-monitor

Package: open-ndi-monitor
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libsdl2-2.0-0, libsamplerate0
Description: Fullscreen NDI video receiver
 Fullscreen NDI video monitor with automatic source discovery,
 audio output with resampling, and reconnection logic.
 .
 Features:
  * Automatic NDI source discovery on local network
  * SDL2-based fullscreen video display
  * Audio output via SDL2 with libsamplerate resampling to 48kHz
  * Automatic reconnection with exponential backoff
  * INI-style configuration file support